# AST conformance engine pins

## Root cause

The scheduled AST workflow measures reviewed engine revisions from `resources/engine-pins.json`. Its JavaScript reference build also needs the matching dependency in `package.json`. Those revisions precede merged AST fixes in carve-js, carve-php, and carve-rs, so the workflow measures old behavior.

## Change

Advance the three reviewed engine pins to their current main commits with `scripts/set-engine-pin.mjs`. Update the npm lockfile for the JavaScript reference dependency. Keep the Ruby pin and the conformance oracle unchanged. Run the AST workflow at these revisions, then file engine-specific bugs with reproductions for any remaining divergence.

## Scope

The pins select complete engine builds used across the corpus and all AST shards. They do not special-case any listed shape, document, or expected tree.
